Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Escaping to Safety
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazey, Slowy, and the four little goats were taken captive,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,used as leverage against Weslie and Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The two faced a life-or-death dilemma:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,whether they won the match or stalled for time, it was a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,With the bomb about to detonate, what fate awaits them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Since there’s no way out, let’s give this method a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The bomb is about to go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy and Coach have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera must have captured them. Please help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gave you these?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s the way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, what are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, do you remember this move?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.72,0:01:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Haste makes waste; don’t overthink it. Relax and the opportunity will come naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I never would have mastered this move without those words of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the Lightning Attack dribble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie is using the basketball technique Coach taught him…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,…trying to wake up Mr. Slowy and Coach…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That device won’t be broken by something so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick and roll—that was the first tactic you ever taught us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a trick that will get you one basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Launch a counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, can they really hear us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust Mr. Slowy and Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Betting it all on these two points—I’m going to bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s help out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can they hear our voices?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They can. If you send your feelings with all your heart, they’ll reach no matter the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, Mr. Slowy…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember how you were always on the sidelines, cheering your hearts out for us at every match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, you were the one who believed in my abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so I could keep running wild on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right, Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You also told us to use our skills to win over those who doubted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To give it our all on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To trust and care for our teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To always stay confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:04:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, Mr. Slowy, do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Senior, don’t run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So, does that mean you’re willing to be our coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, Mr. Slowy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s…go to the finals together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sink the bucket!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,End it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The door is opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually managed to…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor, would you really go against the Wolf Clan just to save that bunch of goats?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to play a fair and impartial final match against Team Defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:06:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A fair and impartial final…isn’t winning all that matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The process doesn’t matter at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan has already failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve removed the chips you planted on our teammates, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t have counted on you in the first place…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re of no use to me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Without me, who’s going to play the rest of the matches?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, obviously…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,…me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve got plenty of chips; once I take control of Tank and the others again…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.48,0:06:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the new Team Wolves will be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You…you’re despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, your playing style doesn’t require teammates anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whereas I…I can bring out their full potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Robo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture the Team Defenders and stop them from competing in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s great that everyone is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were we let out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And our bombs have been deactivated, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone save us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s take the chips off for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs hurt so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy looks like he’s aged all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach doesn’t seem to have changed much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So sore…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to explain—let’s get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Target spotted; commencing capture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you guys should go ahead…leave us behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We won’t be able to escape if you’re dragging us along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and go to the finals!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.24,0:08:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you aren’t there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,are we really still Team Defenders?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.44,0:08:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a room over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s duck in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.56,0:09:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it’s you lot—the Mighty Little Defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You know us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy these happy times while they last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.32,0:09:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get my hands on the wish, this world will be mine to rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They vanished…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s so advanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get going; the finals are about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, it’s an upgraded device.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.12,0:10:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, you will follow my orders to the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves has been formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The members of Team Defenders still haven’t checked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be…that they’ve given up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To think they’d be late for the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, they’ll definitely make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are the little goats doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only ten minutes left; if Team Defenders doesn’t show up, they’ll be disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At this speed, we’re bound to get caught sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There are just too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, Coach, stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys need to hurry to the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.20,0:11:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re going together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought we’d actually agree on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy! Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your top priority right now is making it to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We absolutely cannot let the Basketball Game’s wish fall into Vera’s hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That mysterious man is definitely going to bring harm to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Won’t you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys…you have to win.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
